<title>USA: Matthews International Corp Q4 net rose.</title>
<headline>Matthews International Corp Q4 net rose.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited, in Thousands, except Share Data)</p>
<p>			     Three months ended	Year ended</p>
<p>				 September 30	   September 30</p>
<p>			     1996	 1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Sales		   $43,697    $41,847   $171,978   $166,748</p>
<p> Operating Profit	6,493	5,387     26,771     24,458</p>
<p> Income before Taxes   5,996	5,189     33,523     25,079</p>
<p> Income Taxes	    1,840	1,871     13,265	9,628</p>
<p> Net Income		4,156	3,318     20,258     15,451</p>
<p> Earnings per Share(A)  0.47	 0.38	 2.28	 1.75</p>
<p>Weighted Average</p>
<p>  Shares	     8,868,126  8,850,350  8,890,912  8,850,350</p>
<p>(A) Excluding one-time adjustments recorded in the 1996 second quarter, earnings per share were $1.95 for the fiscal year ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
